    "text": "By Staff Report ,\n1 days ago WARSAW — A Chicago doctor is facing felony charges in Kosciusko County after police say he was giving IV treatments out of his home in Warsaw without a license to practice medicine in Indiana. Sixty-two-year-old Michael Close has been charged with two counts of practicing medicine without a license... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
